{"title":"2021 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2021 AMC 12A #12</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">2021 AMC 10A #14</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(brute_force)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (brute force)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(🚀_Just_2_min_🚀)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (🚀 Just 2 min 🚀)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Hawk_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Hawk Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_(Using_Vieta&#39;s_Formulas_&amp;_Combinatorics)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Using Vieta's Formulas &amp; Combinatorics)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Power_Of_Logic_(Using_Vieta&#39;s_Formulas)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Power Of Logic (Using Vieta's Formulas)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_CanadaMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by CanadaMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>All the roots of the polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee95a55deaeb1ca730505826c05a30c12ac5d1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^6-10z^5+Az^4+Bz^3+Cz^2+Dz+16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"320\" height=\"16\" /> are positive integers, possibly repeated. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/4/6c4e5132eecb88c702573ad20a95a3f535ab7fb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }{-}88 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }{-}80 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }{-}64 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }{-}41\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }{-}40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"471\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By Vieta's formulas, the sum of the six roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the product of the six roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. By inspection, we see the roots are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/b/b4b9576f9af1f99f51d809f9f296bed620eff800.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 1, 2, 2, 2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so the function is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/6936a83c4774aa430b18a7a17694bbd06b84d41f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(z-1)^2(z-2)^4=(z^2-2z+1)(z^4-8z^3+24z^2-32z+16)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"475\" height=\"19\" />. Therefore, calculating just the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/704e9969bd090004be46cb1cbb380cd1bc2525c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^3$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> terms, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/0/cb0693a543f52238376e065d88e565cd5fade8b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = -32 - 48 - 8 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }{-}88}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"248\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~JHawk0224\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the same method as Solution 1, we find that the roots are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/d/acde51185b656cea19b4517f725e4ae23d00dac3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2, 2, 2, 2, 1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is the negation of the 3rd symmetric sum of the roots. Using casework on the number of 1's in each of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/6/aa605a0d3846a7bc6afee06929ad71b004679b39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom {6}{3} = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"81\" height=\"55\" /> products <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/4/884660660cd0fb1c41f608668b60f116f7e01b49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_a \\cdot r_b \\cdot r_c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"11\" /> we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/4/f24718ee669124e49dff8e9563ca68a3e55125aa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[B= - \\left(\\binom {4}{3} \\binom {2}{0} \\cdot 2^{3} + \\binom {4}{2} \\binom{2}{1} \\cdot 2^{2} \\cdot 1 + \\binom {4}{1} \\binom {2}{2} \\cdot 2 \\right) = -\\left(32+48+8 \\right) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }{-}88}.\\]\" width=\"707\" height=\"53\" />\n~ike.chen\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28brute_force.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(brute_force)\">Solution 3 (brute force)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (brute force)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Same as solution 1, we find the roots are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/d/38dd26a78ab086ff25e8c0b0c776cf4e3e2b1786.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"17\" /> by Vieta's formula. This next part is brute force expansion.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/b/0bb2509aff27dff465f9c8a04e73b74214430d90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-B=\\\\r_1r_2r_3+r_1r_2r_4+r_1r_2r_5+r_1r_2r_6+\\\\r_1r_3r_4+r_1r_3r_5+r_1r_3r_6+\\\\r_1r_4r_5+r_1r_4r_6+\\\\r_1r_5r_6+\\\\r_2r_3r_4+r_2r_3r_5+r_2r_3r_6+\\\\r_2r_4r_5+r_2r_4r_6+\\\\r_2r_5r_6+\\\\r_3r_4r_5+r_3r_4r_6+\\\\r_3r_5r_6+\\\\r_4r_5r_6\\\\=2 \\times 4 + 4 \\times 12 + 8 \\times 4\\\\ =8 + 48 + 32\\\\B = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }{-}88}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"283\" />\n</p><p>~yhbettysun\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28.F0.9F.9A.80_Just_2_min_.F0.9F.9A.80.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(🚀_Just_2_min_🚀)\">Video Solution (🚀 Just 2 min 🚀)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (🚀 Just 2 min 🚀)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/s6MGGjPv1n0\">https://youtu.be/s6MGGjPv1n0</a>\n</p><p><i>~Education, the Study of Everything</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Hawk_Math\">Video Solution by Hawk Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Hawk Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AjQARBvdZ20\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AjQARBvdZ20</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_.28Using_Vieta.27s_Formulas_.26_Combinatorics.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_(Using_Vieta's_Formulas_&amp;_Combinatorics)\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Using Vieta's Formulas &amp; Combinatorics)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Using Vieta&#39;s Formulas &amp; Combinatorics)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5U4MJTo3F5M\">https://youtu.be/5U4MJTo3F5M</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Power_Of_Logic_.28Using_Vieta.27s_Formulas.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Power_Of_Logic_(Using_Vieta's_Formulas)\">Video Solution by Power Of Logic (Using Vieta's Formulas)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Power Of Logic (Using Vieta&#39;s Formulas)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/rl6QtVnIbdU\">https://youtu.be/rl6QtVnIbdU</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/t-EEP2V4nAE?t=1080\">https://youtu.be/t-EEP2V4nAE?t=1080</a> (for AMC 10A)\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ySWSHyY9TwI?t=271\">https://youtu.be/ySWSHyY9TwI?t=271</a> (for AMC 12A)\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_CanadaMath\">Video Solution by CanadaMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by CanadaMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8D29aL7clFc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8D29aL7clFc</a> (For AMC 10A)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A\" title=\"2021 AMC 10A\">2021 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2021 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"